"Override GUI listen address. Set this to an address (``0.0.0.0:8384``) or a "
"URL (``http://0.0.0.0:8384``). Supported schemes are ``http`` for plain "
"HTTP, ``https`` for HTTP over TLS, ``unix`` for plain Unix sockets or "
"``unixs`` for TLS over Unix sockets. A Unix socket could look like this: "
"``unix:///run/syncthing/syncthing.socket`` (notice the three slashes: two as "
"part of the URL structure, one to specify an absolute path)."
